msgctxt "game_options"
msgid "The month of your birthay."
msgstr "Zure urtebetetzearen hilabetea."

#. TRANSLATION: xenia, xenia-canary
msgctxt "game_options"
msgid "The sample count of every tile will be incremented on every EVENT_WRITE_ZPD by this number. Setting this to 0 means everything is reported as occluded."
msgstr "EVENT_WRITE_ZPD bakoitzean, lauza bakoitzaren lagin kopurua zenbaki honetan handituko da. 0 ezartzen bada, dena okluditutzat jotzen da."

