msgctxt "game_options"
msgid "The theme color of the emulated console."
msgstr "Emulatutako kontsolaren gaiaren kolorea."

#. TRANSLATION: ppsspp
msgctxt "game_options"
msgid "There is generally no point in going beyond 4x texture scaling unless you are running at very high resolutions."
